<title>UK: Bacob Overseas sets 10 bln yen FRN/fixed bond.</title>
<headline>Bacob Overseas sets 10 bln yen FRN/fixed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Painewebber International UK.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BACOB OVERSEAS LTD</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    BASE	*6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    19.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE   FRN/FIXED     MARGIN     +30 BP    PAY DATE    18.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> DENOMS (M) 100</p>
<p> NOTES     *FOR FIRST TWO YEARS THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR ON</p>
<p>		18.FEB.99 A COUPON OF 2.62 PCT THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
